Rac1 Nb4 { [%emt 0:00:21] [%think 1353] [%out 1582] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0]
[%cachewrite 1436] The a3 variation below is a line I calculated myself, not an
engine evaluation. **Idea:** White's d3 pawn has nothing defending it. Nb4
